  "description": "The SUV D6 is the embodiment of versatility and has compact wheels and a folding frame that stores in seconds. This stable bike is great for maneuvering through busy streets, along the waterfront or for storage in a camper van. It's a gateway to get out and play. DELTECH technology ensures precision and durability, offering seamless performance for diverse riding conditions.\n\nPowered by DELTECH\n\nFeaturing DELTECH—key patents of DAHON-V technology—SUV D6 offers superior frame rigidity for outstanding speed and safety. This powerful synergy enhances pedaling efficiency, making even uphill rides a breeze.\n\nQuick-Fold Design\n\nWith its intuitive folding mechanism, the SUV D6 folds down quickly for easy transport and storage, perfect for those on the go\n\nEffortless Pedaling\n\nDesigned for smooth operation, the crank on the SUV D6 ensures a responsive and enjoyable pedaling experience, whether climbing hills or cruising on flat terrain\n\nPowerful Performance\n\nFeaturing a Shimano 6-speed system, the SUV D6 offers smooth gear transitions, making it easy to conquer both hills and flat terrains with confidence\n\nComfort on Every Ride\n\nEquipped with an ergonomic saddle and adjustable handlebars, the SUV D6 ensures a comfortable riding position, whether you're commuting or exploring",
